data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_01daf6ab8ac10446016aca500ade0081959593787f169d0046","output_index":0,"sequence_number":101,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing server HTML forms**\n\nI’m focusing on creating server HTML forms with native post redirects that are accessible, robust, and simple. I need to set up tests using Node to verify temp database creation and HTML generation, while checking for errors. It's interesting that no frontend is necessary; I can rely on just HTML. I'll make sure to include labels and project headings to avoid any conflicts. Additionally, I’ll serve CSS inline and ensure the database can handle parsing up to 64kb. I'll dive into these tasks!"}

